Before planning or building site work, read `ai-hq/MISSION.md`, `ai-hq/BACKLOG.md`, and `ai-hq/HANDOFF.md`.

Shared artifacts live under `ai-hq/`:
- `inbox/` — files Zak uploads from phone (e.g. Grok audits)
- `audits/` — processed audits
- `previews/` — screenshots pushed for phone viewing

At session end (when you did meaningful work): update BACKLOG checkboxes, rewrite HANDOFF, append TODAY, commit if appropriate.
